    "notes": {
        "11111111-e2e0-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "content": "## ⚠️ CreateOrder – dynamic inspector\n\nWhen the flow is saved in the designer, the engine (dev-automated-00001) **wipes the Line Items** (dynamic inspector). The automated E2E runner is **not affected** — it uploads the flow via the API and starts it immediately, with no designer save in between.\n\n### For a MANUAL test in the designer\nSet the Line Item by hand (otherwise you get a red “Should exclusively match one schema” error):\n\n- **Item Type:** Custom\n- **Title:** Appmixer E2E Line Item\n- **Price:** 9.99\n- **Quantity:** 2\n\n(The store has no product variants, so don't use Variant + Variant ID.)",
            "height": 304,
            "width": 320,
            "x": 448,
            "y": 96
        }
    }
